  "description": "<p>I would appreciate some instruction on how to issue a SPARQL update to change a property nested in a blank node.</p>\n\n<p>Say I have the following resource (book1): <br/>\nbook1  hasAuthor _:a1<br/>\nbook1  hasAuthor _:a2<br/>\n_:a1   foaf:name 'Bob'<br/>\n_:a2   foaf:name 'Betty'</p>\n\n<p>How would I change _:a2 foaf:name?</p>\n\n\n<p>There should also be a test in the suite that shows this is possible</p>",
